  "body": "Step 3 of [the update a style block algorithm](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/semantics.html#update-a-style-block) in the current specification aborts the algorithm when _element_ is not in a [shadow-including document](https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#in-a-shadow-including-document):\n\n> If element is not in a shadow-including document, then abort these steps.\n\nThis would mean that `shadowRoot.stylesheets` would not include a stylesheet when the shadow root is disconnected from a document. That doesn't reflect what we discussed in w3c/webcomponents#56.\n\nWe should update this step to say:\n\n> If element's root is not a shadow root or a document, then abort these steps.\n> or\n> If element is not in a shadow root or in a document tree, then abort these steps.\n",
